WEBVTT

00:07.757 --> 00:09.009
This is it.

00:09.092 --> 00:10.969
Yes, I think so.

00:13.555 --> 00:14.681
<i>All right.</i>

00:15.265 --> 00:16.850
<i>Come on over.</i>

00:18.435 --> 00:20.603
<i>What are you all afraid of?</i>

00:21.813 --> 00:23.606
<i>You've finally found...</i>

00:24.566 --> 00:28.028
<i>the center of the world.</i>

00:29.654 --> 00:31.531
<i>O Fated Ones,</i>

00:33.533 --> 00:36.578
<i>I welcome your arrival.</i>

00:40.623 --> 00:42.375
Kai, what's wrong?

00:44.210 --> 00:45.336
Reiren.

00:45.420 --> 00:47.547
Didn't you hear the voice just now?

00:47.630 --> 00:48.757
Voice?

00:49.382 --> 00:50.383
Rinne?

00:53.720 --> 00:54.637
There's a voice...

00:55.638 --> 00:57.057
coming from inside.

01:00.435 --> 01:02.604
Reiren, be our lookout.

01:03.271 --> 01:04.189
Be your lookout?

01:04.272 --> 01:06.024
Do you guys want to go inside?

01:09.486 --> 01:13.198
There's nothing strange in there!

02:54.841 --> 02:56.509
This place looks like the Crypt.

02:57.010 --> 03:00.346
I can feel a strong power.

03:00.430 --> 03:01.806
It's a bit like mana

03:01.890 --> 03:03.182
but different.

03:03.766 --> 03:05.268
It's a power similar to mine.

03:08.021 --> 03:09.105
There's light?

03:14.527 --> 03:15.945
This is...

03:23.161 --> 03:26.331
Is that the stone statue
that Reiren mentioned?

03:27.790 --> 03:29.542
Is this an ancient temple?

03:30.835 --> 03:31.878
I'm not sure.

03:32.712 --> 03:33.546
But...

03:34.297 --> 03:37.133
I feel like
I've seen that statue somewhere.

03:38.593 --> 03:40.720
<i>Thank you for coming all this way,</i>

03:42.096 --> 03:44.349
<i>beloved Children of Fate.</i>

03:46.184 --> 03:47.560
That voice just now.

03:47.644 --> 03:49.062
Where did it come from?

03:49.145 --> 03:51.397
<i>Isn't it right here?</i>

03:51.481 --> 03:53.608
<i>Right in front of you.</i>

03:53.691 --> 03:55.235
Right in front of us?

03:55.318 --> 03:58.321
Could it be that this statue is talking?

03:58.404 --> 03:59.656
<i>Yes.</i>

03:59.739 --> 04:01.491
<i>There's no need to be wary of me.</i>

04:02.242 --> 04:06.162
<i>As you can see, I'm very weak right now.</i>

04:07.538 --> 04:08.957
Who are you?

04:10.291 --> 04:14.712
<i>I'm a being from the world
where the Five Races Great War has ended.</i>

04:16.422 --> 04:17.924
<i>I've been waiting</i>

04:18.675 --> 04:20.677
<i>in this new world</i>

04:20.760 --> 04:24.013
<i>for someone qualified
to replace Sid to arrive.</i>

04:24.097 --> 04:25.598
You know Sid?

04:26.182 --> 04:30.103
<i>Of course. I know him very well.</i>

04:30.895 --> 04:32.313
<i>Even better than you.</i>

04:33.147 --> 04:34.148
What do you mean?

04:34.983 --> 04:38.903
<i>Please take a closer look.
You should know.</i>

04:49.205 --> 04:50.373
Are you...

04:51.249 --> 04:52.583
the God of Prophecy?

04:52.667 --> 04:54.168
<i>That's right.</i>

04:54.252 --> 04:58.506
<i>You humans call me the prayer god
who sees into the future,</i>

04:59.257 --> 05:01.342
<i>Asurasoraka.</i>

05:02.093 --> 05:04.137
Kai, what's the meaning of this?

05:04.220 --> 05:07.557
Didn't I tell you before
that in my original world,

05:07.640 --> 05:09.642
Prophet Sid defeated
the heroes of the four races

05:09.726 --> 05:12.437
and ended the Great War?

05:13.187 --> 05:15.023
Sid was the one
bestowed with the prophecy.

05:15.606 --> 05:17.400
That's why he was called the Prophet.

05:18.234 --> 05:19.569
The Prophet?

05:19.652 --> 05:20.486
That's right.

05:21.070 --> 05:22.196
And...

05:22.280 --> 05:25.783
the one who bestowed upon Sid
the prophecy and the shining sword

05:25.867 --> 05:28.453
was Asurasoraka, the God of Prophecy.

05:28.536 --> 05:30.204
The God of Prophecy...

05:30.288 --> 05:31.789
So this statue

05:32.290 --> 05:33.291
is a god?

05:34.208 --> 05:35.793
I find it hard to believe too.

05:36.711 --> 05:39.464
I've always believed
that there was a human hero named Sid.

05:40.339 --> 05:43.384
But the legend of the God of Prophecy
should just be a fairy tale.

05:44.010 --> 05:45.678
<i>In the distant past,</i>

05:45.762 --> 05:49.265
<i>humans once worshiped me with reverence.</i>

05:49.849 --> 05:52.852
<i>That's why when the Great War broke out,</i>

05:52.935 --> 05:57.815
<i>I created the Code Holder
as a trump card to protect humanity.</i>

06:02.945 --> 06:06.365
<i>Code Holder can cut through fate.</i>

06:07.742 --> 06:12.330
<i>Cut through the unnecessary fate of death
from this world.</i>

06:13.790 --> 06:15.958
The voice I heard back then... Was it you?

06:16.834 --> 06:18.920
<i>It seems you've finally remembered.</i>

06:19.003 --> 06:20.171
Yeah.

06:21.255 --> 06:23.424
You've been a great help all this time.

06:24.133 --> 06:29.680
<i>You were able to find the Code Holder
in this world without Sid.</i>

06:30.389 --> 06:31.933
<i>I'm really happy about that.</i>

06:33.851 --> 06:37.188
Then what purpose does God have
for summoning us?

06:38.481 --> 06:40.650
<i>I have a prophecy for you.</i>

06:42.485 --> 06:46.322
<i>In my current state, this is all I can do.</i>

06:47.740 --> 06:50.284
<i>To create the Code Holder,</i>

06:50.368 --> 06:53.788
<i>I've used up all my power.</i>

06:54.956 --> 07:00.419
<i>That's why
I couldn't stop this World Rebirth.</i>

07:01.003 --> 07:02.213
Please tell me.

07:02.797 --> 07:05.049
What exactly is the World Rebirth?

07:06.843 --> 07:08.594
<i>It's a shame.</i>

07:08.678 --> 07:11.389
<i>That question is beyond my understanding.</i>

07:12.014 --> 07:13.433
I see.

07:13.516 --> 07:15.518
<i>One thing is certain.</i>

07:15.601 --> 07:20.398
<i>This world has been overwritten
by false history.</i>

07:22.150 --> 07:26.362
<i>This World Rebirth resulted in
the eradication of Sid's existence.</i>

07:26.946 --> 07:29.782
<i>Naturally, the history
of humanity's victory was erased.</i>

07:29.866 --> 07:32.368
<i>In the end, this false world was created.</i>

07:32.452 --> 07:33.369
Wait a minute!

07:33.953 --> 07:35.621
I still can't believe it.

07:36.414 --> 07:37.331
In this world,

07:37.415 --> 07:41.085
we humans have been fighting
against other races for decades.

07:41.669 --> 07:43.921
And you're saying it's all false?

07:44.630 --> 07:46.716
Are you saying our efforts,

07:46.799 --> 07:47.675
our sacrifices,

07:47.758 --> 07:49.177
are all false?

07:50.428 --> 07:53.473
<i>It's actually quite the opposite, Jeanne.</i>

07:53.973 --> 07:55.057
The opposite?

07:55.892 --> 08:00.229
<i>This World Rebirth
has overturned the fate of the world.</i>

08:00.313 --> 08:03.399
<i>However, this reversal is incomplete.</i>

08:04.150 --> 08:05.359
What do you mean?

08:05.943 --> 08:10.364
<i>If the world is completely reversed,</i>

08:10.448 --> 08:13.451
<i>what do you think
would happen to this place?</i>

08:14.911 --> 08:15.870
Well--

08:15.953 --> 08:18.122
It would be a world
where humanity perished.

08:19.582 --> 08:20.917
<i>Exactly so.</i>

08:21.792 --> 08:26.005
<i>However,
humanity didn't perish in this world.</i>

08:26.547 --> 08:29.050
<i>Because of your hard-fought battles,</i>

08:29.133 --> 08:31.135
<i>not only did humanity not get wiped out,</i>

08:31.219 --> 08:33.471
<i>but they're fighting back
little by little.</i>

08:34.472 --> 08:36.474
<i>This world is false,</i>

08:36.557 --> 08:40.311
<i>but your hard-fought battles
are an indelible fact.</i>

08:42.897 --> 08:44.899
Hearing you say that puts me at ease.

08:46.234 --> 08:48.152
You have a purpose.

08:48.236 --> 08:49.445
What?

08:50.446 --> 08:53.449
<i>It is your duty to right this false world,</i>

08:54.033 --> 08:55.493
<i>Prophet Jeanne.</i>

08:57.203 --> 09:01.457
<i>Please take Sid's place
and be the hero of this world.</i>

09:02.792 --> 09:05.169
Why... me?

09:05.670 --> 09:08.756
<i>I've been watching this world.</i>

09:10.216 --> 09:15.137
<i>Humanity has long been oppressed
by four other powerful races.</i>

09:15.805 --> 09:16.806
<i>Among them,</i>

09:17.390 --> 09:19.559
<i>including Jeanne,</i>

09:19.642 --> 09:22.979
<i>there are only a handful of candidates</i>

09:23.688 --> 09:25.273
<i>qualified to replace Sid</i>

09:25.356 --> 09:28.109
<i>and can be entrusted
with the fate of the world.</i>

09:29.860 --> 09:30.736
<i>Of course,</i>

09:30.820 --> 09:34.490
<i>you're one of them
since you defeated the demon hero.</i>

09:35.283 --> 09:36.367
Me?

09:36.450 --> 09:40.371
<i>However, strength is the only thing
you are worthy of.</i>

09:41.372 --> 09:45.459
<i>You were never meant
to exist in this world.</i>

09:46.961 --> 09:48.337
<i>Therefore,</i>

09:48.421 --> 09:51.841
<i>I have determined that Jeanne
is the most suitable candidate.</i>

09:52.800 --> 09:54.844
What do you want me to do?

09:55.428 --> 09:57.471
<i>The same thing you have done so far.</i>

09:57.555 --> 10:00.224
<i>Lead your men and continue to fight.</i>

10:00.308 --> 10:02.143
<i>Defeat the heroes of the four races</i>

10:02.727 --> 10:06.063
<i>and that creature called Rasterizer.</i>

10:07.231 --> 10:10.818
<i>Do that, and the world will be restored.</i>

10:11.736 --> 10:12.987
Defeat that monster?

10:13.946 --> 10:16.949
Do you know what Rasterizer really is?

10:19.577 --> 10:20.995
<i>No.</i>

10:21.078 --> 10:25.916
<i>It's a strange monster
that didn't exist in the original history.</i>

10:26.000 --> 10:28.169
A monster that didn't exist?

10:28.961 --> 10:30.546
Allow me to ask you a question.

10:30.630 --> 10:33.883
If we defeat the heroes
of the four races and Rasterizer,

10:34.467 --> 10:36.177
what will happen to this world?

10:39.472 --> 10:41.807
<i>It depends on the corrosion
of the World Rebirth.</i>

10:43.309 --> 10:48.606
<i>No one knows how much
the world has been overwritten.</i>

10:49.357 --> 10:53.235
<i>Would it be restored to the original world
where humanity was victorious,</i>

10:53.319 --> 10:57.823
<i>or would this world continue to function
as a world where humanity has triumphed?</i>

10:58.532 --> 11:01.035
<i>Until that time comes, we don't know.</i>

11:02.161 --> 11:06.874
<i>Right now, we just need
to think about how to let humanity win.</i>

11:06.957 --> 11:08.542
<i>There's no need to hesitate.</i>

11:09.126 --> 11:11.462
<i>Only with determination
can you make the answer right.</i>

11:13.422 --> 11:14.507
<i>Also, Kai.</i>

11:15.966 --> 11:18.135
<i>I have high expectations of you.</i>

11:18.219 --> 11:19.387
Expectations...

11:19.470 --> 11:22.223
<i>And you too, over there.</i>

11:22.306 --> 11:23.140
What?

11:23.724 --> 11:26.560
<i>All right, go forth now, Jeanne.</i>

11:27.436 --> 11:30.439
<i>Set forth to become
the new hero of humanity.</i>

11:37.196 --> 11:39.031
Rinne, are you all right?

11:40.324 --> 11:41.951
I'm fine.

11:42.535 --> 11:43.744
What's wrong?

11:43.828 --> 11:45.830
You've been quiet for a while.

11:46.705 --> 11:48.124
I don't get it.

11:48.207 --> 11:49.041
What?

11:49.667 --> 11:50.709
That voice.

11:51.794 --> 11:53.879
I can't truly tell

11:54.547 --> 11:56.215
whether or not she's dangerous.

11:57.425 --> 11:58.551
I see.

11:59.051 --> 12:01.887
It's music to my ears,

12:01.971 --> 12:03.806
but I don't like it for some reason.

12:04.723 --> 12:06.725
It's okay, Rinne.

12:08.269 --> 12:10.604
If she's the creator of Code Holder,

12:10.688 --> 12:13.232
at least she shouldn't be
an enemy of humanity.

12:15.943 --> 12:17.445
That's all we need to know for now.

12:20.156 --> 12:22.741
Goodness, I got so tired from waiting!

12:22.825 --> 12:23.993
I'm sorry.

12:24.493 --> 12:26.328
There's nothing special, right?

12:26.412 --> 12:27.913
- Well--
- That's right.

12:28.539 --> 12:31.041
There's just an odd stone statue.

12:32.042 --> 12:33.836
Let's hurry back.

12:33.919 --> 12:35.588
We made our subordinates wait too long.

12:41.135 --> 12:42.136
Right!

12:42.219 --> 12:44.388
- Hey, Rinne.
- What? What is it?

12:44.472 --> 12:45.848
Pick that for me.

12:47.224 --> 12:48.767
It's the fruit of Winter Balsam.

12:48.851 --> 12:52.271
It can be used to make
an elixir that cures all ailments.

12:53.439 --> 12:55.483
Why me?

12:55.566 --> 12:57.401
You can fly, can't you?

12:58.110 --> 12:59.778
You just don't want the hassle, right?

12:59.862 --> 13:02.531
Prophet Jeanne...

13:04.074 --> 13:05.159
Don't worry about it.

13:06.869 --> 13:07.870
Kai.

13:08.913 --> 13:11.874
I'll fight alongside you
until the very end.

13:13.584 --> 13:16.003
You want to end
the Five Races Great War, right?

13:17.296 --> 13:18.297
That's right.

13:19.215 --> 13:21.383
I'll do my best for that too.

13:22.218 --> 13:24.470
Yes.

13:25.304 --> 13:26.889
This has no connection to the prophecy.

13:27.890 --> 13:30.059
I'm just doing what I'm supposed to do.

13:30.768 --> 13:32.853
You haven't changed at all

13:33.604 --> 13:35.231
both in the original world

13:35.314 --> 13:36.649
and this world.

13:36.732 --> 13:40.945
I still can't fully believe that, but...

13:41.445 --> 13:45.658
in the original world,
what was our relationship?

13:46.242 --> 13:49.078
Well, we were childhood friends

13:49.161 --> 13:50.162
and colleagues.

13:50.746 --> 13:51.747
Is that all?

13:53.582 --> 13:55.292
I guess you could say we're friends.

13:58.170 --> 13:59.255
Is that so?

13:59.838 --> 14:03.175
Then, can we be friends in this world too?

14:03.926 --> 14:05.553
Of course.

14:05.636 --> 14:08.514
But would that be any different from now?

14:08.597 --> 14:13.060
You're probably the only one
who can befriend me and play it cool.

14:13.143 --> 14:14.770
Isn't there anyone else?

14:14.853 --> 14:15.980
Nope.

14:18.732 --> 14:20.526
I keep smelling something strange.

14:20.609 --> 14:22.695
It's very effective for wounds.

14:22.778 --> 14:23.863
What? This?

14:25.030 --> 14:26.490
Quit your whining and get a move on.

14:26.574 --> 14:29.159
- Come on, let's go.
- Here, hold this for me too.

14:29.243 --> 14:30.327
All of it?

14:37.376 --> 14:38.919
I told you, if you drink this,

14:39.003 --> 14:41.672
the wound on your left arm
will heal in no time!

14:41.755 --> 14:42.923
You're lying.

14:43.007 --> 14:46.135
This is just muddy water made
from melted rotten strawberries.

14:46.218 --> 14:48.721
No, it's an elven elixir!

14:48.804 --> 14:51.432
Kai will die
if he drinks something so stinky!

14:51.515 --> 14:53.434
Goodness, you're so noisy! Watch me.

14:57.771 --> 14:59.481
Look, just like this.

14:59.565 --> 15:02.693
It's a bit pungent,
but it feels refreshing going down--

15:05.070 --> 15:06.071
Reiren?

15:08.741 --> 15:10.743
Reiren, hang in there!

15:12.870 --> 15:14.788
As they say, good medicine tastes bitter.

15:15.748 --> 15:17.666
It's so lively.

15:17.750 --> 15:18.667
Yeah, totally.

15:19.585 --> 15:21.295
I'm... I'm okay.

15:21.378 --> 15:23.547
Here, you can drink it now, right?

15:24.423 --> 15:26.216
Thank you.

15:26.300 --> 15:27.176
It's no good.

15:27.259 --> 15:28.761
Don't drink it, Kai.

15:28.844 --> 15:30.596
You might really die if you drink this.

15:30.679 --> 15:31.680
Well, but...

15:32.264 --> 15:34.642
it's an elven elixir, after all.

15:36.060 --> 15:39.647
<i>We will soon be crossing the border
and entering the Yurun Federation.</i>

15:39.730 --> 15:41.982
<i>All vehicles, please be on high alert.</i>

15:42.066 --> 15:43.150
Roger that.

15:48.906 --> 15:51.158
Are you okay?
You won't vomit blood, right?

15:52.618 --> 15:54.036
This seems okay.

15:56.789 --> 15:57.998
What's that?

15:58.082 --> 16:00.584
Hey, Kai. Do you know what that is?

16:02.086 --> 16:03.337
Is it a building?

16:03.963 --> 16:06.757
It's pitch-black
with a perfect triangular shape.

16:07.341 --> 16:08.342
It feels like a ruin.

16:09.343 --> 16:10.803
Are you talking about...

16:11.303 --> 16:12.388
the Crypt?

16:13.764 --> 16:16.600
I remember that
in the world Kai used to live in.

16:16.684 --> 16:20.312
That's the structure used
to seal the four races, right?

16:20.396 --> 16:21.730
That's right.

16:21.814 --> 16:24.233
The one in the Yurun Federation

16:24.316 --> 16:27.277
should be the Crypt
that sealed the Spirit Race.

16:28.612 --> 16:29.822
We're surrounded.

16:33.534 --> 16:34.702
Stay on your toes!

16:46.505 --> 16:47.548
Fire!

16:57.182 --> 16:58.726
Get in and take cover!

17:04.606 --> 17:05.607
Take this!

17:12.156 --> 17:15.576
The Spirit Race
consists of protists with mana organs.

17:17.077 --> 17:19.079
Their bodies have no fixed form.

17:19.163 --> 17:20.414
If we want to defeat them,

17:20.497 --> 17:22.374
we have to set them ablaze.

17:23.625 --> 17:24.585
But...

17:28.380 --> 17:29.673
Fire all at once!

17:37.014 --> 17:37.890
What?

18:02.039 --> 18:04.500
Agni Burst!

18:14.051 --> 18:17.805
Are you guys okay,
members of the Urza Resistance?

18:19.848 --> 18:21.183
Lord Balmung.

18:23.143 --> 18:25.479
It's been a while, Falin.

18:25.562 --> 18:27.397
How long has it been?

18:27.481 --> 18:28.482
That won't do.

18:28.565 --> 18:30.859
I should be thanking you
for coming all the way here,

18:30.943 --> 18:33.320
the Light Knight, Lord Jeanne.

18:33.403 --> 18:37.032
We should be thanking you
for saving us from danger,

18:37.616 --> 18:40.369
Commander of the Yurun Resistance,
Lord Balmung.

18:42.371 --> 18:43.872
By the way,

18:43.956 --> 18:45.541
facing off against the Spirit Race,

18:45.624 --> 18:47.709
especially in a sudden ambush

18:47.793 --> 18:49.586
and even when deeply surrounded,

18:49.670 --> 18:52.089
I'm impressed you managed to hold out.

18:52.172 --> 18:54.424
- Let's hurry, Lord Jeanne.
- After all, they are...

18:54.508 --> 18:55.467
What?

18:56.301 --> 18:57.636
Hold on, Falin!

18:58.220 --> 18:59.721
I'm not done talking yet.

19:00.389 --> 19:03.183
- Listen to what I have to say.
- You'll just keep prattling on.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.437
Forget it.

19:07.938 --> 19:09.148
Everyone, retreat!

19:10.691 --> 19:11.608
Hey, Kai.

19:12.943 --> 19:13.861
They're still nearby.

19:25.414 --> 19:27.291
- Get ready to fire!
- Get ready to set fire!

19:27.374 --> 19:28.584
- Fire!
- Set fire!

19:41.722 --> 19:43.223
This is troublesome.

19:43.307 --> 19:46.518
I have no idea
what the Spirit Race's magic can do.

19:47.019 --> 19:48.103
Magic?

19:50.105 --> 19:51.648
Jeanne, clear a path!

19:52.357 --> 19:53.609
We'll make a break for it!

20:13.962 --> 20:15.797
All vehicles, move forward!

20:22.095 --> 20:24.181
As expected
from the dwarves' special creation,

20:24.264 --> 20:26.934
the authentic Mystic Elf Bullet.

20:31.855 --> 20:33.440
<i>That was close.</i>

20:33.941 --> 20:37.277
<i>You seem to have
an excellent subordinate, Lord Jeanne.</i>

20:38.612 --> 20:42.282
<i>He's not my subordinate, but my friend.</i>

20:42.366 --> 20:43.617
<i>Friend?</i>

20:43.700 --> 20:44.618
<i>That's nice--</i>

20:44.701 --> 20:46.578
<i>By the way, Lord Balmung,</i>

20:46.662 --> 20:48.038
we need a strategy meeting.

20:48.121 --> 20:49.456
<i>You're right.</i>

20:50.374 --> 20:54.086
<i>But before that,
there's somewhere I'd like to stop by.</i>

20:58.757 --> 21:00.634
Actually, we came here

21:00.717 --> 21:03.804
to investigate this lake.

21:03.887 --> 21:05.222
Investigate?

21:05.305 --> 21:07.599
One look at the map and you'll know it.

21:08.183 --> 21:10.644
This is the Grand Arc Plains.

21:11.144 --> 21:15.107
There were originally no lakes.

21:15.190 --> 21:16.024
What?

21:16.608 --> 21:18.068
No.

21:18.151 --> 21:20.445
That's not a lake.

21:20.946 --> 21:22.322
It's not a lake?

21:22.823 --> 21:23.865
That's right.

21:23.949 --> 21:25.033
It's the Spirit Race.

21:27.995 --> 21:29.371
This is...

21:42.217 --> 21:43.218
That's...

21:45.178 --> 21:46.263
Could it be...

21:48.348 --> 21:49.558
Darn you.

21:49.641 --> 21:52.102
You've been hiding in a place like this?

21:53.437 --> 21:55.314
Hero of the Spirit Race...

21:56.398 --> 21:59.151
The Spirit Sovereign, Rikugen Kyoko!

22:01.987 --> 22:02.988
Humans.

22:05.324 --> 22:06.325
What a nuisance.
